{"ts":1793393683870,"event":"done","summary":"PLAT-103 shipped. Changes: (1) shared-contracts 2.0.0 (PR #1): validateApp throws if app.owner is missing or empty; major bump since it is breaking for callers. (2) core-shell (PR #2), billing (PR #3), reports (PR #4): pass owner from package.json team (platform / payments / insights), bump @mfe/shared-contracts to ^2.0.0 with lockfiles regenerated. All CI and CD green. Assumptions: owner is hardcoded to match package.json team rather than read at runtime; the contract was bumped to 2.0.0 (not 1.1.0) because the throw breaks callers that omit owner; platformkit does not call validateApp so it is untouched; the apps were updated after the contract was published so the apps did not break on ordering."}
